@@ -8,6 +8,12 @@ package, not for somebody reading this repository's commit log.
 
 ## [Unreleased]
 
+### Added
+
+- Tool calls are validated against each registered tool's JSON Schema before execution; invalid input is returned to the model as a corrective tool result.
+- Required fields, declared types and enum values are checked by the registry before an executor runs; extra properties remain available to the executor. Invalid calls are returned to the model for correction within the configured tool-round limit.
+- Migration note: executors that previously hand-validated input now receive only schema-accepted input. An executor that relied on seeing malformed input to create its own error message will no longer see those calls. This is a minor version change.
+
